### Search API test requests (VS Code REST Client, as in Labs 3 to 5)
# 1. Start the API: npm run dev
# 2. Make a token:  node ../shared/scripts/make-test-token.js student
# 3. Paste it below. Contact-request tests also need an alumni token:
#    node ../shared/scripts/make-test-token.js alumni
# 4. Until Daniel's and Ahmed's /internal routes exist, run the stand-ins in a
#    second terminal (npm run mock-services) and point IDENTITY_API_URL and
#    PROFILE_API_URL in .env at ports 4003 and 4001.

@base = http://localhost:3002/api
@internal = http://localhost:3002/internal
@token = PASTE-STUDENT-TOKEN-HERE
@alumToken = PASTE-ALUMNI-TOKEN-HERE
@serviceKey = PASTE-SERVICE-KEY-FROM-.env

### Health check (no login needed) -> 200
GET {{base}}/health

### ---------- Normal cases ----------

### All alumni, first page -> 200
GET {{base}}/alumni
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search by skill -> 200
GET {{base}}/alumni?q=python
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search by name -> 200
GET {{base}}/alumni?q=omar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter by location and industry -> 200
GET {{base}}/alumni?location=cairo&industry=Cybersecurity
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter by graduation year, newest first, page 1 -> 200
GET {{base}}/alumni?gradYear=2016&sort=newest&page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Near me: alumni within 50 km of Cairo, closest first -> 200 with distanceKm
GET {{base}}/alumni?near=Cairo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Near me with a radius and other filters -> 200
GET {{base}}/alumni?near=Alexandria&radiusKm=25&industry=Software
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### No matches -> 200 with an empty list (not 404)
GET {{base}}/alumni?q=zzzz
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- Invalid cases ----------

### Unknown parameter -> 400
GET {{base}}/alumni?role=admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Industry not in the list -> 400
GET {{base}}/alumni?industry=Hacking
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Graduation year in the future -> 400
GET {{base}}/alumni?gradYear=2099
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unsupported sort -> 400
GET {{base}}/alumni?sort=password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Page out of range -> 400
GET {{base}}/alumni?page=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Same parameter twice -> 400
GET {{base}}/alumni?q=a&q=b
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Place that does not exist -> 400 LOCATION_NOT_FOUND
GET {{base}}/alumni?near=Qwertyville
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### radiusKm without near -> 400
GET {{base}}/alumni?radiusKm=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### radiusKm too large -> 400
GET {{base}}/alumni?near=Cairo&radiusKm=9999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### sort=distance without near -> 400
GET {{base}}/alumni?sort=distance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Not a valid id -> 404
GET {{base}}/alumni/123
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- Security cases ----------

### No login -> 401
GET {{base}}/alumni

### Forged token -> 401
GET {{base}}/alumni
Authorization: Bearer abc.def

### SQL injection attempt -> 200 with no results, nothing leaks
GET {{base}}/alumni?q=%27%20OR%201%3D1--
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Wildcard characters are searched literally -> 200, no results
GET {{base}}/alumni?q=%25%25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Hidden fields: a student must not see a field the owner hid.
### Pick an id from the results above whose owner hid their location, then compare with an admin token.
GET {{base}}/alumni/PASTE-PROFILE-ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- Contact requests ----------

### Student sends a request -> 201 (copy an alumni id from the search results)
POST {{base}}/contact-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "alumniId": "PASTE-PROFILE-ID", "message": "Hello, I am a CS student interested in your field." }

### Same request again while the first is pending -> 409
POST {{base}}/contact-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "alumniId": "PASTE-PROFILE-ID", "message": "Hello, I am a CS student interested in your field." }

### Message too short -> 400
POST {{base}}/contact-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "alumniId": "PASTE-PROFILE-ID", "message": "hi" }

### Extra field (trying to set status) -> 400
POST {{base}}/contact-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "alumniId": "PASTE-PROFILE-ID", "message": "Hello, can we talk please?", "status": "accepted" }

### An alum cannot send a request -> 403
POST {{base}}/contact-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{alumToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "alumniId": "PASTE-PROFILE-ID", "message": "Hello, can we talk please?" }

### Student: requests I sent (email shown only once accepted) -> 200
GET {{base}}/contact-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Alum: requests I received -> 200
GET {{base}}/contact-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{alumToken}}

### A student cannot answer a request -> 403
PATCH {{base}}/contact-requests/PASTE-REQUEST-ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "accepted" }

### Alum answers a request sent to them -> 200
### (Another alum's token gets 404 for the same id.)
PATCH {{base}}/contact-requests/PASTE-REQUEST-ID
Authorization: Bearer {{alumToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "accepted" }

### Answering twice -> 409
PATCH {{base}}/contact-requests/PASTE-REQUEST-ID
Authorization: Bearer {{alumToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "declined" }

### ---------- Internal (service-to-service) ----------

### No service key -> 401
POST {{internal}}/locations/resolve
Content-Type: application/json

{ "location": "Giza" }

### A user's login token is not a service key -> 401
POST {{internal}}/locations/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "location": "Giza" }

### Correct key -> 200 (cached: false the first time, true after)
POST {{internal}}/locations/resolve
X-Service-Key: {{serviceKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "location": "Giza" }

### Unknown place -> 404
POST {{internal}}/locations/resolve
X-Service-Key: {{serviceKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "location": "Qwertyville" }

### Failure cases to show at the discussion (no request file needed):
### - Stop the Identity service  -> every /api route answers 503 SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE.
### - Stop the Profile service   -> GET /contact-requests still 200, accepted items show contactUnavailable.
### - Wrong GEOCODING_URL         -> near search on a new place 503 GEOCODING_UNAVAILABLE; other searches still 200.
